---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy – FreshFynds"
  description="What information FreshFynds collects and how it is used."
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    FreshFynds does not ask you to create an account. We may use privacy-friendly
    analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics) to count visits and see which pages are
    popular. It does not use cookies to track you across websites.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you email us, we receive your email address and message, and use them
    only to reply.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting:</strong> the site is served by Cloudflare, which processes
      basic technical data such as IP addresses to deliver and protect the site.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fonts:</strong> fonts load from Google Fonts, so your browser
      connects to Google's servers.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Affiliate links:</strong> when you click a link to a store, that
      store and any affiliate network may set cookies to record the referral.
      Their own privacy policies apply on their websites.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. To ask about any
    data we hold from your emails, or to have it deleted,
    <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, we will update this page and the date above.
  </p>
</Layout>
